This application bundles a dataset (assets/data/theographic.json) derived from
Theographic Bible Metadata by Robert Rouse / Viz.Bible,
https://github.com/robertrouse/theographic-bible-metadata, licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Changes: converted to a
compact JSON form by scripts/build_theographic.dart (record links resolved to
array indexes, Easton's dictionary text flattened to plain text, verse ids
decoded to book/chapter/verse references); one corrected verse link ("Death of
Moses" pointed to Genesis 34:1 upstream, a book/verse-ID collision, corrected
to Deuteronomy 34:1). As a derivative of that dataset, assets/data/theographic.json
is itself licensed CC BY-SA 4.0; the application code remains under the Apache
License 2.0.

