This application bundles Easton's Bible Dictionary (assets/data/easton_sword.zip)
as distributed by the CrossWire Bible Society, https://www.crosswire.org/sword/,
under CrossWire's "Public Domain" module distribution license. The underlying
text (M.G. Easton, "Illustrated Bible Dictionary", Third Edition, Thomas
Nelson, 1897) is itself public domain — the author died in 1894 and the work
was first published in 1897. Bundled unmodified.

